<view class="page service-page"><view wx:if="{{createdOrderId}}" class="card">
    <view class="section-title">订单已创建</view>
    <view class="muted">请前往已有订单查看状态或继续支付，无需重复下单。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{navigationError}}" class="error">{{navigationError}}</view>
    <button bindtap="openCreatedOrder" loading="{{navigating}}" disabled="{{saving || navigating}}">前往已有订单</button>
  </view><empty-state wx:if="{{loading}}" message="正在加载…"/><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button bindtap="load">重试</button></view><block wx:if="{{community && !createdOrderId}}"><view wx:if="{{recoveryHint}}" class="card restored">{{recoveryHint}}</view><view class="card"><view class="page-masthead"><image class="masthead-icon" src="/assets/icons/elder.png"/><view class="masthead-copy"><view class="page-title">陪诊预约</view><view class="masthead-subtitle">贴心照料，安心相伴</view></view></view><view class="muted">仅由已核验陪诊资质的服务员提供。按北京时间，可选今天至 30 天后，完整服务时长须落在小区值班时段。</view><view wx:if="{{addresses.length > 1}}" class="field"><text class="label">服务地址</text><picker range="{{addresses}}" range-key="buildingName" value="{{addressIndex}}" bindchange="addressChange"><view class="picker">{{addressText}} · 切换地址</view></picker></view></view><view class="card"><view class="field"><text class="label">医院</text><input value="{{form.hospital}}" data-field="hospital" bindinput="change" maxlength="100" placeholder="请输入医院名称"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">科室</text><input value="{{form.department}}" data-field="department" bindinput="change" maxlength="100" placeholder="请输入科室"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">预约日期</text><picker mode="date" start="{{escortDateStart}}" end="{{escortDateEnd}}" value="{{escortDateNeedsSelection ? escortDateStart : form.date}}" data-field="date" bindchange="change"><view class="picker">{{escortDateNeedsSelection ? '请选择预约日期' : form.date}}</view></picker><view wx:if="{{escortDateNeedsSelection}}" class="muted">原预约日期已超出可预约范围，请重新选择。</view></view><view class="field"><text class="label">开始时间</text><picker mode="time" value="{{form.start}}" data-field="start" bindchange="change"><view class="picker">{{form.start}}</view></picker>
    <view wx:if="{{escortStartHint}}" class="muted escort-start-hint">{{escortStartHint}}</view>
  </view><view class="field"><text class="label">服务时长（每档 2 小时，1—4 档）</text><input type="number" value="{{form.blocks}}" data-field="blocks" bindinput="change"/><view class="muted">按小区陪诊每档价格计费。</view></view><view class="field"><text class="label">需要接送</text><switch checked="{{form.pickup}}" data-field="pickup" bindchange="change"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">备注（选填）</text><textarea value="{{form.note}}" data-field="note" bindinput="change" maxlength="100"/></view><view class="muted">陪诊师只协助挂号取号、陪同、缴费取药和记录医嘱，不代替患者问诊、转述病情或签署医疗文书。</view></view><view wx:if="{{quoteError}}" class="error">{{quoteError}}<button class="retry" bindtap="retryQuote">重新报价</button></view><price-bar amount="{{amount}}" reason="{{quote && quote.reason || ''}}" disabled="{{escortDateNeedsSelection || !quote || quoteLoading || !slots.length}}" loading="{{saving}}" bind:submit="submit"/></block></view><privacy-popup/>
